{title: 081 - Though I Speak With Tongues}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #081 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 81}
{meta: category God the Father - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Though [F#m]I [A]speak [G]with [F#m]tongues [G]of men [F#m]and [D/A]angels,
[Bm]Though [A7/E]I [C]have [G]the [A]prophet's [G#m]gift,
[C]Though [G7/F]I [Bm]hold [F#m]the [G]keys [A]to [G]hidden [A7/G]knowledge,
[A]Though [Bm]my [F#m]faith [D]can [Em]mountains [F#m]shift:
[D]Without [Bm]love I [A]am [F#m]no [A]better,
[D]Without [A]love [F#m]it's [D]all [G]for [Em]naught;
[A7/G]Lord, [F#m]You [Em]spent [A7]Your [Bm]life [A]in [F#m]loving [A]others:
[Bm]What this [F#m]means [G]I [A]would [F#m/C#]be [D]taught.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Love [F#m]is [A]patient, knows [G/D]no [Em]envy,
[Bm]Never [C]gloats [G]when [A]others [G#m]sin;
[C]Love [G7/F]is [Bm]never [G]glad [A]to [G]see [Em]injustice,
[A]Always [F#m]wants [D]the [Em]truth [D]to [F#m]win.
[D]There's [C#dim]no [Bm]end to [A]love's [D]endurance,
[D]There's [Bm]no [A]test [F#m]it [D]cannot [Em]face;
[A7/G]Lord, [F#m]You [Em]spent [A7]Your [Bm]life [A]in [F#m]loving [A]others:
[Bm]I shall [F#m]fail [G]without [F#m/C#]Your [D]grace.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]Though [F#m]there'll [G]be [F#m]an [Bm]end [G]to hidden [D/A]knowledge,
[Bm]Visions, [C]raptures, [Bm]prophecy:
[C]Faith [G7/F]and [Bm]hope [F#m]and [G]love [A]shall [G]last [Em]forever,
[A]Love [Bm]the [F#m]greatest [Em]of [D]the [F#m]three.
[D]Without [Bm]love I [A]am [F#m]no [A]better,
[D]Without [A]love [F#m]it's [D]all [G]for [Em]naught;
[A7/G]Lord, [F#m]You [Em]gave [A7]Your [Bm]life [A]in [F#m]saving [A]others:
[Bm]What this [F#m]means [G]I [A]would [F#m/C#]be [D]taught.
{end_of_verse}
